---
layout: base.njk
title: Stories & Journaling
navActive: stories
solidNav: true
---

<style>
  .stories-section { padding: 4rem 8rem 7rem; background: var(--cream); }
  .stories-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; }
  .story-card {
    background: var(--warm-white); overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: block;
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }
  .story-card.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .story-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 18px 48px var(--soft-shadow); transform: translateY(-5px) !important; }
  .story-card.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  .card-img { height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 4.5rem; }
  .story-card.wide .card-img { height: 260px; font-size: 6rem; }
  .ci1{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8d4a0,#c4882a);}
  .ci2{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#c8dcc0,#5a8a52);}
  .ci3{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d8c8e8,#7858a8);}
  .ci4{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8c8b8,#b84828);}
  .ci5{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#c8d8e8,#4878a8);}
  .ci6{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8d8b8,#987830);}
  .card-body { padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem 2rem; }
  .card-body h3 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--deep-brown); margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
  .story-card.wide .card-body h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .card-body p { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.68; color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .story-tag { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terracotta); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .card-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .card-read-time { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--sienna); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .card-read-time::before { content: '✦'; font-size: 0.5rem; }
  .card-link { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terracotta); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
  .card-link:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--terracotta); }
  /* Vermont History */
  .histography-band { background: linear-gradient(160deg,#3b2510,#1a0f08); padding: 5rem 8rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; align-items: center; }
  .hb-left .section-label { color: var(--gold); }
  .hb-left h2 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem); font-weight: 400; color: var(--cream); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .hb-left p { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.75); margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .btn-ghost-light { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cream); background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.4); padding: 0.9rem 2rem; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
  .btn-ghost-light:hover { background: var(--cream); color: var(--deep-brown); }
  .hb-entries { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; }
  .hb-entry { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start; padding: 1.4rem; border-left: 2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3); transition: border-color 0.3s, background 0.3s; cursor: pointer; }
  .hb-entry:hover { border-left-color: var(--gold); background: rgba(245,240,232,0.05); }
  .hb-year { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gold); min-width: 55px; padding-top: 2px; }
  .hb-entry-text h4 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .hb-entry-text p { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.6); line-height: 1.6; }
  @media(max-width:1024px){.stories-section{padding:4rem 3rem 5rem;}.stories-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}.story-card.wide{grid-column:span 2;}.histography-band{padding:4rem 3rem;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem;}}
  @media(max-width:720px){.stories-section{padding:3rem 1.5rem 4rem;}.stories-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.story-card.wide{grid-column:span 1;}.histography-band{padding:3rem 1.5rem;}}
</style>

<div class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-inner">
    <h1 class="page-title">Stories &<br><em>Lifestyle</em></h1>
    <p class="page-desc">Words on farming, gardening, walks in the woods, the quiet practice of journaling, and the history hidden in everyday things.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="stories-section">
  <div class="section-divider"><h3>All Writing</h3></div>
  <div class="stories-grid" id="storiesGrid">
    {% set allStories = collections.stories | reverse %}
    {% for post in allStories %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="story-card{% if loop.index == 1 or loop.index == 6 %} wide{% endif %}" style="text-decoration:none;">
      <div class="card-img ci{{ (loop.index0 % 6) + 1 }}">
        {% if post.data.image %}
          <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;">
        {% else %}
          📖
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-read-time">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</span>
          <span class="card-link">Read →</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% else %}
    <a href="/stories/" class="story-card wide" data-category="vermont-history" style="text-decoration:none;">
      <div class="card-img ci1">🌾</div>
      <div class="card-body"><h3>On Buying the Wrong Seeds and Starting Anyway</h3><p>My first season farming, I ordered the wrong variety of winter squash. What came from that mistake turned out to be one of the most instructive growing seasons I've had.</p><div class="card-meta"><span class="card-link">Read →</span></div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="/stories/" class="story-card" data-category="lifestyle" style="text-decoration:none;">
      <div class="card-img ci2">🌿</div>
      <div class="card-body"><h3>Notes from the Kitchen Garden</h3><p>What started as a small raised bed turned into a years-long conversation with a small patch of Vermont soil.</p><div class="card-meta"><span class="card-link">Read →</span></div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="/stories/" class="story-card" data-category="lifestyle" style="text-decoration:none;">
      <div class="card-img ci3">📓</div>
      <div class="card-body"><h3>Why I Still Write by Hand</h3><p>In a world of screens and speed, keeping a handwritten journal is the one daily practice I refuse to give up.</p><div class="card-meta"><span class="card-link">Read →</span></div></div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>


<script>
function filterStories(category, btn) {
  document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
  btn.classList.add('active');
  document.querySelectorAll('#storiesGrid .story-card').forEach(card => {
    card.style.display = (category === 'all' || card.dataset.category === category) ? '' : 'none';
  });
}
document.querySelectorAll('.story-card').forEach((card, i) => {
  setTimeout(() => { card.classList.add('visible'); }, i * 80);
});
</script>
